# Build-context exclusions (spec 018, C3). Patterns anchor at the context root, so every one
# carries a **/ prefix to also match nested files. The Containerfile copies only
# pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md and src/; this is the second line of defence.

# Personal data and secrets
**/resume
**/profile
**/data
**/config.toml
**/*.local.toml
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.migrated-*
**/*token*.json
**/*client_secret*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# VCS, agent and editor state
**/.git
**/.claude
**/.idea
**/.vscode

# Not part of the image
**/tests
**/specs
**/.github
**/scripts
**/examples
**/extension

# Caches and build output
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/dist
**/build
**/*.egg-info
